From 8e48c6cfb1bee690cd4b1e1d9ddf984b89e40b7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:06:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] perf(network): sync machine recipes by id

MachineSyncPacket now carries the recipe id when the current recipe is
the exact instance registered under that id in the server recipe
manager, which the client already received. The dummy recipe is sent as
neither id nor recipe, anything else is still sent in full.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TD7PJ5R7t7hM3ymeeqXP4H
---
